sequence-diagram

typeface clean
styleMode shadow
colorMode pastel
autoNumber on

Customer [icon: user, label: "Customer"] > Checkout [label: "Checkout and Orders"]: Submit checkout with idempotency key
Checkout > Database [icon: aws-rds, label: "PostgreSQL"]: Create order in pending payment state
Checkout > Payment [label: "Payment Provider"]: Create payment
Payment --> Checkout: Timeout or connection loss
Checkout > Database: Mark payment outcome unknown
Checkout --> Customer: Return processing status without creating another charge

Payment > Callback [label: "Payment Callback Endpoint"]: Send provider webhook with transaction identifier
Callback > Database: Lookup order and deduplicate callback
Database --> Callback: Return current payment state
Callback > Database: Commit paid state and outbox event
Database --> Callback: Commit complete

Reconciler [label: "Payment Reconciliation Worker"] > Database: Find stale unknown payments
Reconciler > Payment: Query provider using merchant reference
Payment --> Reconciler: Return authoritative payment status
Reconciler > Database: Apply idempotent state transition or compensation

Customer > Checkout: Retry with the same idempotency key
Checkout > Database: Read existing order and payment state
Database --> Checkout: Return existing result
Checkout --> Customer: Return the same order without duplicate charge
